Step 1: Create variables

Create these 3 variables:

Variable	Type
numList	List(Of Integer)
sortedList	List(Of Integer)
result	String

For List(Of Integer), choose Browse for Types → System.Collections.Generic → List<T> → Integer.

Step 2: Create the list

Add Assign:

To:

numList

Value:

New List(Of Integer) From {50,20,40,10,30}
Step 3: Sort the list

Add another Assign:

To:

sortedList

Value:

numList.OrderBy(Function(x) x).ToList()
Step 4: Convert list to text

Add another Assign:

To:

result

Value:

String.Join(", ", sortedList)
Step 5: Display output

Add Message Box:

"Sorted List: " + result
